{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100940","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100940/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100940/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100940/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100940","id":2763500309,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6kt6sV","number":100940,"title":"Removed scene is recreated","user":{"login":"miv391","id":49998025,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTk4MDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49998025?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391","html_url":"https://github.com/miv391","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/miv391/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-12-30T17:29:41Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T20:04:20Z","closed_at":"2024-12-31T20:04:11Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.dev7.mono.official [46c8f8c5c]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.dev7.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-3570K CPU @ 3.40GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAlready deleted scene is recreated on scene save.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open reproduction project.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc94f45e-ec2c-4f2c-b3a8-0a2049eda254)\n\n2. select `myscene.gd` and `myscene.tscn` in the FileSystem view.\n3. Select \"Delete\" from popup menu \n4. Confirm deletion by pressing \"Remove\" \n=> `myscene.gd` and `myscene.tscn` disappear from FileSystem view as expected. But the deleted scene is still visible in the scene tree.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4f55c9b4-ee07-44d7-baf7-eca0d9ca461a)\n\n5. Press `Ctrl-S` to save scene\n\n**=> BUG**: `myscene.tscn` is back in FileSystem:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b92e0e56-f405-4eb5-9d5b-987408d60b0a)\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n- created project\n- created root node and a folder for myscene\n- created myscene, added sprite and script\n\n`.godot` folder (without `shaders` and `mono`) is included. It looks like that removing `.godot` folde will prevent scene recreation happening.\n\n[scene_removing.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18276655/scene_removing.zip)\n","closed_by":{"login":"tetrapod00","id":145553014,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKz2dg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145553014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00","html_url":"https://github.com/tetrapod00","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetrapod00/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100940/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}